{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "c351d80f-b75f-8d3c-84ca-b792ca83b772",
  "created_at": "2025-12-23T12:57:25-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Tariq Haddad",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:53:22-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:53:27-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Yes. I want to make a complaint. Noise. Construction noise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:53:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a construction noise complaint. Where is the construction?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:53:36-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is next to my house. [line breaks up] Two five nine Rhode Island Avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:53:43-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, you broke up. Was that two fifty-nine Rhode Island Avenue?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:53:49-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Two fifty-nine. Rhode Island Avenue. Historic Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:53:53-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And what's happening there? What time does the noise start?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:53:59-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Before seven. The crew comes, the trucks, the hammer, the saw. Before seven in the morning. Six, maybe six-fifteen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:54:07-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Six-fifteen in the morning. And how many days has this been going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:54:13-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Since Monday. Yesterday, and today again. Two days. I am sleeping, and then no more sleeping."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:54:20-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's no good. Okay, so Monday the twenty-second and again this morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:54:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Monday and today. [inaudible] Every morning is the same."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:54:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, I missed the end of that. Can you say it again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:54:37-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Every morning the same. Same time. Very early."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:54:41-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll write it all down. Do you know which company it is, or is there a sign on the site?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:54:50-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No sign. I do not see. A white truck, and a big blue truck. No name I can read."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:54:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all right. We can still log it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:55:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Should I call the police instead? The non-emergency line? Maybe that is better."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:55:08-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can, if it's happening right now and it's bothering you, the non-emergency line is the right one, not 911. But I'll also pass this to the office that handles construction work and permits, so there's a record of the early starts. Doing both is fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:55:26-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Both. [pause] I am annoyed. I am home, it is the holiday week, I want quiet in the morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:55:35-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I hear you. Let me get a number in case they need to reach you. Is this the number you're calling from?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:55:45-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Four zero one, five five five, zero one five six."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:55:50-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-five-six. Perfect. And can I have your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:55:55-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tariq Haddad. H-A-D-D-A-D."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:55:57-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Haddad. Do you want me to note that you prefer a call back, or just have them look into it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:56:07-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Call back is okay. But, short. My English is slow on the phone. My family helps me, but now she is at work."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:56:17-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. I can speak a little Spanish, but I don't think that helps here. We'll keep it simple. Is there a better time of day to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:56:29-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Afternoon. After twelve. I am home. [line breaks up] I walk Sunday mornings only, the Cliff Walk, when there is no ice. Other days I am home."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:56:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so afternoons, any day but Sunday morning. I've got that noted."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:56:45-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Sunday morning I am not home. Only when it is not icy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:56:51-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, understood. So to repeat: two fifty-nine Rhode Island Avenue, construction crew starting before seven, since Monday, and you'd like a call back in the afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:57:02-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, correct. That is everything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:57:05-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll send it over today. I can't tell you exactly when someone will call, with the holiday coming, but it's logged."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:57:14-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I hope tomorrow is quiet. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:57:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hope so too. Happy holidays, Mr. Haddad. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T12:57:23-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Bye."
    }
  ],
